==Trivia==
*Darkweb may be a mistranslation. Its Japanese name is Black Wave (ブラックウェーブ ''Burakku Wēbu''), but ウェーブ ''wēbu'' (wave) could have been mistaken for ウェブ ''webu'' (web).

